{"openapi":"3.0.0","paths":{"/v1/funding-events":{"get":{"description":"Returns funding events ordered by announcement date, newest first. Costs one credit per returned record.","operationId":"funding_events_list","parameters":[{"name":"enrichedOnly","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Return only rounds whose company we resolved — the ones carrying a domain, industry, country and description. Rounds we could not place still ship by default, because for some markets we are the only source that reports them at all; this is how a caller who needs enriched records asks for just those.","schema":{"example":true,"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"cursor","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Opaque pagination cursor returned as pagination.nextCursor.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"since","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Return events announced on or after this date (YYYY-MM-DD). ISO-8601 timestamps are also accepted.","schema":{"example":"2026-05-01","type":"string"}},{"name":"until","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Return events announced on or before this date (YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive). ISO-8601 timestamps are also accepted.","schema":{"example":"2026-05-30","type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Maximum records to return.","schema":{"minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20,"type":"number"}},{"name":"round","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Funding round filters. Repeat the query key for multiple values.","schema":{"example":["seed","series-a"],"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["pre-seed","seed","angel","series-a","series-b","series-c","series-d","series-e","series-f","series-g","series-h","series-i","growth","private-equity","extension","bridge","convertible","safe","debt","grant","pre-ipo","secondary","pipe","other"]}}},{"name":"minAmountUsd","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Minimum funding amount in USD.","schema":{"minimum":0,"example":1000000,"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxAmountUsd","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Maximum funding amount in USD.","schema":{"minimum":0,"example":50000000,"type":"number"}},{"name":"naicsCode","required":false,"in":"query","description":"NAICS 2022 code for the company. Matches the code and everything beneath it, so \"51\" also returns 5132 and 5173. Any 2- to 6-digit NAICS code is accepted; codes deeper than we classify (e.g. 541511) match at their deepest classified parent (5415). Sector ranges work: \"31-33\" returns all manufacturing. Pass \"unknown\" for companies we could not classify.","schema":{"example":"5132","type":"string","enum":["11","111","1114","113","114","21","2111","212","22","2211","2213","23","236","2361","238","2382","31-33","311","3111","3115","3116","3117","3118","3121","3122","313","315","316","3162","321","322","3222","323","325","3253","3254","3255","3256","3261","327","3272","331","332","3323","3325","3328","3331","3332","3334","3341","3342","3343","3344","3345","335","3351","3352","3353","3359","336","3361","3363","3364","3365","3366","337","3372","3391","3399","42","4231","4233","4234","4235","4236","4238","4244","4245","4246","4247","4248","44-45","4411","4441","4451","4491","4561","4571","458","4591","4593","48-49","4811","482","483","484","485","4851","4853","4921","493","51","5121","5122","5131","5132","5161","5162","5173","519","5192","52","5221","5231","5239","5241","5242","53","5311","5312","532","5322","54","5411","5412","5413","5414","5415","5416","5417","5418","5419","5511","56","5613","5614","5615","5616","5617","562","5621","611","6111","6113","6114","6115","621","6213","6214","6215","6216","622","623","6241","6242","6244","71","7111","7112","7115","712","7132","7139","721","722","7225","81","811","8111","812","8121","8123","8129","813","8131","8132","8134","8139","92","9211","9221","9281","unknown"]}},{"name":"countries","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Headquarters country codes (OR). Repeat the query key for multiple values. Use `unknown` to match companies with no country on file.","schema":{"example":["US","GB"],"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV","MW","MX","MY","MZ","NA","NC","NE","NG","NI","NL","NO","NP","NR","NU","NZ","OM","PA","PE","PF","PG","PH","PK","PL","PM","PR","PS","PT","PW","PY","QA","RE","RO","RS","RU","RW","SA","SB","SC","SD","SE","SG","SH","SI","SK","SL","SM","SN","SO","SR","SS","ST","SV","SX","SY","SZ","TC","TD","TG","TH","TJ","TK","TL","TM","TN","TO","TR","TT","TV","TW","TZ","UA","UG","US","UY","UZ","VA","VC","VE","VG","VI","VN","VU","WF","WS","YE","YT","ZA","ZM","ZW","unknown"]}}},{"name":"industryGroups","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Company industry groups (OR). Repeat the query key for multiple values. Values are the LinkedIn industry labels listed here, matched case-insensitively; older LinkedIn names (e.g. Computer Software) and common short forms (e.g. software) map to the current label. Use `unknown` to match companies with no industry on file.","schema":{"example":["Software Development","Financial Services"],"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["Defense and Space Manufacturing","Computer Hardware Manufacturing","Software Development","Computer Networking Products","Technology, Informati